  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Girls for STEM and Leadership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project therefore aims to host a fun interactive session for high school girls in the Shiselweni and Lubombo regions. Girls from these areas have limited role models, especially for STEM courses. This is meant to encourage them to do STEM subjects already to continue as well as bring information about career options in these fields. Fun-filled science days with planned team-building activities for the young girls as well as science activities such as coding and/or robotics activities. The plan is also to have exhibiting STEM-based companies to showcase career opportunities in STEM.</narrative>
  </description>
